    "The unifier can mint only through the TOKEN_MINTER role, granted by a Safe initializer a day after its deployment; that grant is the reset (rule 10).",
    "Campaign: the 15 later fake-pool swapV3 calls by other actors, until the role was revoked. Minted INT kept by attackers is dilution, not depletion. The 925M bridged INT one copycat drained from the Convertor reserve was never sold; it is listed at its realised value of zero (rule 15).",
